// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-024
=adr: 024
=title: Implicit Application Context via Route-Based Scoping
=date: 2026-02-23
=status: accepted

#ctx
~problem: ADR-023 added applicationId FK; initial impl added dropdown selectors to DeviceForm + CreateWorkflowModal
~wrong: explicit dropdown allows cross-app entities + violates implicit context intent

#decision
=chosen: application context established by URL route, not by form field
=routing: {
  /applications → list all,
  /applications/[slug] → Application Detail hub (Devices + Workflows + Dashboards tabs),
  /applications/[slug]/devices → scoped device list (optional sub-route)
}
=rules: {
  rule1: all entity creation in /applications/[slug] inherits applicationId from route,
  rule2: DeviceForm + CreateWorkflowModal MUST NOT contain applicationId selectors,
  rule3: Application Detail is primary entry point for app-scoped work,
  rule4: global /devices + /workflows remain for SuperAdmin cross-app admin
}
!remove: applicationId dropdowns from DeviceForm and CreateWorkflowModal

#consequences
+pos: [implicit_scoping_cleaner_UX, ADR-023_rule1_enforced_at_nav_level, no_cross_app_accidents]
-neg: [SuperAdmin_global_views_unaffected→slightly_inconsistent]

#scope
=arch_summary_update: yes
